{"id": "aging-and-workforce-subaward-notices", "title": "Two departments disclosed federal grant terms after making the awards", "seconds": 45.1, "voice": "tinyvoca:F2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "69219a3db5562ea9", "words": 122, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two City agencies gave recipients federal grant information later than required.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.6, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Aging program", "FY2013"], ["Workforce programs", "FY2014"]]}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In the aging program, auditors tested 6 of 8 recipients.", "t0": 4.72, "t1": 8.33, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "previous", "kicker": "First the aging grants", "text": "6 of 8", "mark": "6"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The award notices left out the federal program number.", "t0": 8.45, "t1": 11.4, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "previous", "kicker": "First the aging grants", "text": "Federal program number", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A year later auditors tested two workforce programs.", "t0": 11.62, "t1": 14.81, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Then two workforce programs", "text": "Two workforce programs", "mark": "Two"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One sample covered 12 of 20 recipients. The other covered both recipients.", "t0": 14.93, "t1": 19.87, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Workforce cluster", "12 of 20"], ["Pilot program", "2 of 2"]]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The agency gave them the missing information during monitoring.", "t0": 19.99, "t1": 23.09, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Information supplied later"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Auditors questioned no costs in the workforce finding.", "t0": 23.21, "t1": 26.06, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No questioned costs"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Their report identified no misuse of funds by the recipients.", "t0": 26.18, "t1": 29.44, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "No questioned workforce costs", "text": "Workforce recipients", "mark": "Workforce"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Both departments changed what they included in the original contracts.", "t0": 29.66, "t1": 33.21, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "Both departments changed the original paperwork", "text": "Original contract documents", "mark": "Original"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By FY2015, the audits recorded both corrective actions as implemented.", "t0": 33.33, "t1": 38.09, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "Both departments changed the original paperwork", "text": "FY2015", "mark": "FY2015"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The difference was when recipients could see the rules attached to the money.", "t0": 38.21, "t1": 41.62, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Grant information"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.74, "t1": 44.21, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "First the aging grants", "b": "Then two workforce programs", "o": "Both departments changed the original paperwork"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "timeline", "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca"}
